  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">If you need to get in touch with our customer support team at <a id=\"\" href=\"mailto:support@instapass.io\">support@instapass.io</a>, you may be asked to verify your account with us. This is to ensure that you are the owner of the account for security purposes.</p><p id=\"\">Step 1: Make sure you email <a id=\"\" href=\"mailto:support@instapass.io\">support@instapass.io</a> from the email address that you used to sign up to Instapass with.</p><p id=\"\">Step 2: Our support team will ask you to confirm the “support PIN” to verify that you are the owner of this account.</p><p id=\"\">Step 3: Login to Instapass or refresh the page then click “Profile Settings”.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1187px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"1187px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24948dc43830fd1ddba9_619e12d63a8b74c75fb541e8_p3DkVmugDc2mcDsR55bNbAqq_uQincsCsAP_ohzypLudXvxRNLOQR5SgraY0FY18DC9nLDfdEkzYmVcRl02UHFyrn6i7Jly4iOK16an0Tf_dRX18tMZM__nvOP32kAB3pD0tTl0F.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Step 4: Select Customer Support PIN.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1222px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"1222px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24948dc43830fd1ddba3_619e12d68c7aef57da110dc4_nn_pseGoQgJ63gwlEDGXOL8rKue0nUlHzH8nUqcli-WUYLUT3FMEogCpRULxSRCgL5ZPCyxerCgXvEuRYeHkfLBzdYJ15LuqbPspb97CT17BAO26KYJxkGStwCEfgER8E_Gy4Sh2.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Step 5: You will see a 6 digit PIN code, please email <a id=\"\" href=\"mailto:support@instapass.io\">support@instapass.io</a> to confirm this PIN code. Please note that the code will only be generated after you contact the support team.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1221px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"1221px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24948dc43830fd1ddba6_619e12d75f6ff34b90c4041e_K5UUQC0JAWD4xJc2UQ7Wgz3uulErPBwMA4XQ2AGQZP5Y_WjCfspshOmiUTrJj_NLE9vEDJDJdKqVYgIoSo5HokSHwlUnZEURP797HF_QPlk-80GevfiCSC8qIXke0viGGjtxkPG4.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><br></p>",
